      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Versioning Announcment",
      "Anchor": "versioning-announcment",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Beginning in 2025, new API endpoints and updates will be released on LinkedIn\u0027s versioned APIs. Versioning will allow adoption of new API features on your own schedule, requiring less coordination between you and LinkedIn to deliver increased value to our mutual customers, and will also allow more rapid release of new features to LinkedIn\u0027s developer platform. Calling versioned APIs requires minor changes to how requests are to LinkedIn are structured. This document describes the changes and provides recommendations for to make adoption of new versions easier.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "New Base URL",
      "Anchor": "new-base-url",
      "SectionPath": [
        "New Base URL"
      ],
      "Text": "Versioned APIs will have a new base URL, as described in the table below.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
